DE16 3706             (    forth6809.asm):04825         REPEATW:    PULU  D
DE18 10830001         (    forth6809.asm):04826                     CMPD  #TAGFWD
DE1C 2703             (    forth6809.asm):04827                     BEQ   RPOK1
