DE57 DC1A             (    forth6809.asm):04858                     LDD   MSCR4
DE59 9316             (    forth6809.asm):04859                     SUBD  MSCR2
DE5B DD18             (    forth6809.asm):04860                     STD   MSCR3             ; MSCR3 = bytes to shift
