E213 CCFFFE           (    forth6809.asm):05540                     LDD   #-2               ; -2
E216 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05541                     PSHU  D
E218 7EDCF0           (    forth6809.asm):05542                     JMP   THROWW
                      (    forth6809.asm):05543         
