E345 3410             (    forth6809.asm):05858                     PSHS  X
E347 3620             (    forth6809.asm):05859                     PSHU  Y
E349 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05860                     PSHU  D
E34B 39               (    forth6809.asm):05861                     RTS
